# ── animation frames ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frame webp are served from the orphan `frames` branch, not from main — the
# daily churn was ~6 GB/month of permanent history and forced a full history
# collapse on 2026-08-28. Published by scripts/lib/publish_frames.sh (launchd
# com.scorvec.frames, every 15 min). The *_manifest.json files stay tracked, so
# the viewers still fetch them same-origin.
assets/*/anim/**/*.webp
# EXCEPT the dirs built only by GitHub workflows. The frames branch has a
# SINGLE publisher (the laptop) because several producers force-pushing one
# orphan branch would clobber each other — so these must stay on main for the
# laptop to pull and republish. They are ~10% of the churn.
!assets/sst/anim/gdps_ir/*.webp
!assets/sst/anim/gdps_wind/*.webp
!assets/sst/anim/gdps_outflow/*.webp
!assets/sst/anim/mur_ct/*.webp
!assets/sst/anim/pacsat/*.webp
!assets/sst/anim/samsat/*.webp

# asos5 local runner log
scripts/asos5/asos5.log
